 Partnerships:Mayo Clinic (Clinical trial lead), University of Connecticut School of Medicine (Clinical validation), UPMC (Investigator-initiated studies), Nikao (Manufacturing partner)COMPETITIONPosition:LeaderCompetitors:SciBase, MedLumics, Roswell, Michelson Diagnostics (VivoSight Dx), AI Medical Technology (Dermalyser)LEADERSHIPKey Executives:Cody Simmons - CEOMaurice Ferre, MD - Co-Founder and ChairmanCarolyn Walsh - Chief Commercial OfficerScientific Founders:Maurice Ferre, MD, Christopher Dewey, Irving Bigio (Inventor of ESS technology at Boston University)Board Members:Maurice Ferre, MD, Christopher Dewey, David Matlin, Cody Simmons, Mark Goldwasser (Observer), Russell Ivanhoe (Observer)LINKSWebsite:dermasensor.comLinkedIn:LinkedIn ProfileCrunchbase:Crunchbase ProfileDisclaimer: IntuitionLabs.ai is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with DermaSensor Inc.. The information on this page was compiled using AI from publicly available sources and may be incomplete, outdated, or contain err",
